<title>JAPAN: JT shares jump on gene therapy hopes.</title>
<headline>JT shares jump on gene therapy hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Tobacco Inc (JT) jumped on Monday on hopes that the firm would benefit from approval by the Health Ministry and the Education Ministry on the use of gene therapy for AIDS victims, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0522 GMT, the shares were up 17,000 yen at 908,000.</p>
